# Chuan hoa ky tu xuong dong. Khong co file nay, mot lan sua vai dong tren
# Windows co the ghi lai CA FILE bang CRLF — diff phinh len hang nghin dong, va
# bo quet secret phai soi lai ca noi dung cu roi bao dong gia. Da xay ra that
# voi Telegram.md.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Script chay tren Linux: CRLF lam shebang hong voi thong diep rat kho doc
# ("bad interpreter: /bin/bash^M").
*.sh   text eol=lf
*.py   text eol=lf
*.cjs  text eol=lf
*.ts   text eol=lf
*.yml  text eol=lf
*.yaml text eol=lf

# Nhi phan: khong dung toi.
*.png  binary
*.jpg  binary
